  "title": "Dairy- and Gluten-Free Zucchini Orange Chocolate Chip Muffins",
  "description": "Fresh orange zest perfectly complements these chocolate chip zucchini muffins free of dairy and gluten and topped with a sweet glaze.",
  "authors": [
    "queendiva1"
  ],
